# 1. User Management API

User management is primarily for administrators. Customers should not be able to modify sensitive account fields such as their role, status, or verification state.

## Roles

```text
SUPER_ADMIN
ADMIN
LOAN_OFFICER
FINANCE_OFFICER
SUPPORT
CUSTOMER
```

### 1.1 Get Users

```http
GET /api/v1/users
```

**Access:** `ADMIN`, `SUPER_ADMIN`

### Query parameters

```text
?page=1
&limit=20
&search=james
&role=CUSTOMER
&status=ACTIVE
