# 4. Documents Management API

This module handles:

* Official loan application form download
* Customer application-form upload
* KYC/application documents
* Document review
* Document verification
* Document rejection
* Re-upload after rejection

## 4.1 Download Official Loan Application Form

```http
GET /api/v1/documents/application-template
```

**Access:** Authenticated users.

The endpoint returns:

```text
